  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p> Fingers are sent flying as your hand explodes from the impact of a tight grouping of multiple projectiles. You stare in horror at the mangled mess at the end of your arm.</p> <p><strong>Effects:</strong> Roll 1d10/5 plus one for the number of fingers lost – Amputation (Average). Gain @Condition[Stunned] (3) and @Condition[Bleeding] (1). You also suffer a Broken Bone (Minor).</p>"
    },
